WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.567
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:08.634
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden
appeared last night

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:09.767
at the Grammy Awards.

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:11.934
It was gonna be Joe,
but he's not trusted

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:13.567
with classified material.

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:16.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:18.968
President Biden is set
tomorrow to deliver

00:00:18.968 --> 00:00:20.601
his State of the Union Address,

00:00:20.601 --> 00:00:23.667
and it's not a great sign
that the best he can say is,

00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:27.734
"The state of our union
is balloon-free."

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:29.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.801 --> 00:00:31.767
President Biden told reporters
over the weekend

00:00:31.767 --> 00:00:34.100
that he ordered the military
to shoot down the suspected

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.667
Chinese spy balloon, which
must've been tough,

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:39.734
'cause if anyone loves balloons,
it's this guy.

00:00:39.734 --> 00:00:42.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:44.400
According to a new report
from Bloomberg News,

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.234
New York Congressman
George Santos

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:49.334
once claimed to have been a
producer on the Broadway musical

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:52.634
"Spider-Man: Turn off the Dark".

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:55.234
Another obvious lie,
because if you saw that show,

00:00:55.234 --> 00:00:57.801
you know it didn't have
producers.

00:00:57.801 --> 00:00:59.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:01.667
At an event at the White House
last week,

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:03.501
celebrating
the 30th anniversary of the

00:01:03.501 --> 00:01:04.934
Family and Medical Leave Act,

00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:08.000
former President Bill Clinton
said that he has more people

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.501
bring up this law than,

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:11.701
"any other specific thing
he did."

00:01:11.701 --> 00:01:12.901
Well, I don't know.

00:01:12.901 --> 00:01:16.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.200
I feel like it's the second.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.701 --> 00:01:21.968
That's like OJ saying
most people bring up

00:01:21.968 --> 00:01:23.400
his Hertz commercials.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:26.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:28.567
Authorities in Canada are
searching for two suspects

00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:30.334
who were seen driving
a stolen car

00:01:30.334 --> 00:01:31.567
through a shopping mall.

00:01:31.567 --> 00:01:32.868
Whoa!

00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:35.000
If it was the '90s,
they could've killed someone.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:40.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.234 --> 00:01:44.167
It's such a fancy
abandoned mall.

00:01:44.167 --> 00:01:46.000
According to a new study,
Florida, last year,

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.133
experienced more lightning
strikes than any other state,

00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:50.801
which might mean that even God
is getting tired of waiting

00:01:50.801 --> 00:01:52.100
for Merrick Garland.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:54.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.367 --> 00:01:56.367
The Rock &amp; Roll Hall of Fame has
announced this year's

00:01:56.367 --> 00:01:57.400
class of nominees.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.234
It's the one hall of fame
that understands

00:01:59.234 --> 00:02:02.300
that performance-enhancing drugs
are just part of the game.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:06.267
A federal judge in Oklahoma
recently ruled

00:02:06.267 --> 00:02:09.200
that a law prohibiting marijuana
users from owning guns

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:10.601
is unconstitutional.

00:02:10.601 --> 00:02:12.701
It makes sense, because by
the time they find their gun,

00:02:12.701 --> 00:02:14.367
they forgot what
they were mad about.

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:16.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.567 --> 00:02:26.100
Producers have released
a trailer for a new reality show

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:28.567
about actor Sylvester Stallone
and his family.

00:02:28.567 --> 00:02:31.834
And, yeah, you're probably gonna
need the captions on.

00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:35.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.067 --> 00:02:38.667
A man in Cambodia recently
built a home

00:02:38.667 --> 00:02:40.834
modeled after an airplane,
and now he's finally

00:02:40.834 --> 00:02:44.067
ready to sit back, relax,
and recline his armchair

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:46.634
three inches.

00:02:46.634 --> 00:02:48.334
And finally, in honor
of Valentine's Day,

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:50.367
the restaurant chain
Cracker Barrel has launched

00:02:50.367 --> 00:02:53.334
a new contest that'll give five
couples free food for a year

00:02:53.334 --> 00:02:55.000
if they get engaged
at the restaurant.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.400
Also, doing a promotion
for newly engaged couples

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.501
at Cracker Barrel --

00:02:58.501 --> 00:02:59.734
divorce attorneys.

00:02:59.734 --> 00:03:01.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:04.300
Bless your heart,
but take a card just in case.

00:03:05.501 --> 00:03:07.234
President Biden delivered
his second

00:03:07.234 --> 00:03:08.767
State of the Union Address
tonight.

00:03:08.767 --> 00:03:12.701
Oh, you mean his balloon
assassination victory lap?

00:03:12.701 --> 00:03:14.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.033 --> 00:03:15.667
"You know who would
love some inflation?

00:03:15.667 --> 00:03:17.267
That spy balloon, bitch."

00:03:17.267 --> 00:03:18.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:18.701 --> 00:03:21.467
"But seriously, yeah, eggs are
really expensive right now."

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:23.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:24.801
That's right, the
State of the Union was tonight,

00:03:24.801 --> 00:03:26.367
and U2's Bono attended

00:03:26.367 --> 00:03:28.300
as a guest
of First Lady Dr. Jill Biden.

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.834
And I got to say,
I love that she's using

00:03:30.834 --> 00:03:33.501
the office of first lady
to tick off her bucket list.

00:03:33.501 --> 00:03:35.667
[ Laughter ]
I mean, she was at the Grammys.

00:03:35.667 --> 00:03:37.067
She's going to the Super Bowl.

00:03:37.067 --> 00:03:38.934
Now, she's hanging out
with Bono.

00:03:38.934 --> 00:03:41.133
If Biden gets reelected,
she's going to get

00:03:41.133 --> 00:03:43.534
the old gang together
for one last heist.

00:03:43.534 --> 00:03:45.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:45.434 --> 00:03:49.467
President Biden posted several
photos yesterday to Instagram.

00:03:49.467 --> 00:03:51.567
Not on purpose.
He was trying

00:03:51.567 --> 00:03:53.901
to answer his phone and kept
hitting the wrong button.

00:03:53.901 --> 00:03:55.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:55.534 --> 00:03:58.000
President Biden tweeted
a picture yesterday

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.234
of the first page of his
State of the Union Address

00:04:00.234 --> 00:04:03.667
and I got to say, I'm surprised
how he's kicking things off.

00:04:03.667 --> 00:04:06.033
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:04:06.033 --> 00:04:09.434
The Pentagon said yesterday that
the military failed to detect

00:04:09.434 --> 00:04:12.033
three Chinese spy balloons
over the continental U.S.

00:04:12.033 --> 00:04:15.200
during the Trump administration
due to a "awareness gap"

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.033
and because, after the eclipse,

00:04:17.033 --> 00:04:19.367
Trump wasn't allowed to look
in the sky anymore.

00:04:19.367 --> 00:04:21.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:21.567 --> 00:04:24.200
The first public beach is set
to open this summer

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.033
in Manhattan,
along the Hudson River,

00:04:26.033 --> 00:04:27.667
so, if you see
some beach bodies,

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:30.167
there's a good chance
they washed up there.

00:04:30.167 --> 00:04:32.834
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.834 --> 00:04:35.567
"Yellowstone" actor
Kevin Costner

00:04:35.567 --> 00:04:37.567
is reportedly considering
leaving the series

00:04:37.567 --> 00:04:39.267
to focus on directing
a new film.

00:04:39.267 --> 00:04:41.133
Said your dad, "But, you know,

00:04:41.133 --> 00:04:42.234
other than that, I'm fine.

00:04:42.234 --> 00:04:44.801
Alright, here's your mom."

00:04:44.801 --> 00:04:45.868
[ Laughter ]

00:04:45.868 --> 00:04:47.901
A dog in Nevada
was recently rescued

00:04:47.901 --> 00:04:50.734
after living with a pack
of coyotes for several months.

00:04:50.734 --> 00:04:53.067
Fortunately,
the dog is now safe, sound,

00:04:53.067 --> 00:04:54.534
and embittered for life.

00:04:54.534 --> 00:04:56.901
"I was living the dream!"

00:04:56.901 --> 00:04:59.200
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:03.334
And, finally, the FAA yesterday
proposed fining United Airlines

00:05:03.334 --> 00:05:06.601
more than $1 million
for skipping safety steps.

00:05:06.601 --> 00:05:09.400
Even worse, Spirit put
black electrical tape

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:10.834
over the check engine light.

00:05:10.834 --> 00:05:12.968
[ Laughter ]

00:05:12.968 --> 00:05:14.400
President Biden delivered

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.801
his 2nd State of the Union
Address last night.

00:05:16.801 --> 00:05:19.834
And spoke for 73 minutes
which sounds like a lot.

00:05:19.834 --> 00:05:22.400
But I feel like Biden
could speak for 73 minutes

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:23.801
to a wrong number.

00:05:23.801 --> 00:05:26.300
"Well -- Well,
who were you trying to reach?

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:29.367
Let's try to figure
this out together."

00:05:29.367 --> 00:05:31.033
New York Representative
George Santos

00:05:31.033 --> 00:05:33.267
was reportedly one of the first
members of Congress

00:05:33.267 --> 00:05:35.400
to arrive for last night's
State of the Union.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:37.934
He wanted a good seat.

00:05:37.934 --> 00:05:39.701
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.701 --> 00:05:42.501
"Oh, I -- but I think I am.

00:05:42.501 --> 00:05:44.734
I think I am the President."

00:05:44.734 --> 00:05:45.868
Last night's
State of the Union

00:05:45.868 --> 00:05:48.400
was the first time
since 2019 that the event

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:50.467
was held without
coronavirus restrictions.

00:05:50.467 --> 00:05:51.667
And in case
you're wondering

00:05:51.667 --> 00:05:54.667
who in that room
never reads their e-mails.

00:05:54.667 --> 00:05:55.968
[ Laughter ]

00:05:55.968 --> 00:05:57.300
"For your information,

00:05:57.300 --> 00:06:00.334
this isn't a COVID mask,
this is just for dander."

00:06:00.334 --> 00:06:02.067
[ Laughter ]

00:06:02.067 --> 00:06:04.801
"Very allergic."

00:06:04.801 --> 00:06:06.100
During the speech last night,

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:08.167
Republican Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:06:08.167 --> 00:06:10.400
wore a white fur coat
in the House chamber.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:11.400
And bad news guys --

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:13.100
that was our last one.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:16.100
[ Laughter ]

00:06:18.501 --> 00:06:20.767
She looked great.
It was --

00:06:20.767 --> 00:06:23.501
I think we all agree
it was worth it.

00:06:23.501 --> 00:06:25.200
Georgia Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.167
posted a video to Twitter
yesterday showing herself

00:06:27.167 --> 00:06:29.067
trying to bring a large
white balloon

00:06:29.067 --> 00:06:30.734
as a guest
to the State of the Union.

00:06:30.734 --> 00:06:33.067
And you know, I didn't know
who she'd bring as a guest,

00:06:33.067 --> 00:06:34.634
but I knew they'd be white.

00:06:34.634 --> 00:06:37.634
[ Laughter ]

00:06:37.634 --> 00:06:40.133
President Biden said
last night some Republicans

00:06:40.133 --> 00:06:42.367
are threatening to repeal
the Inflation Reduction Act.

00:06:42.367 --> 00:06:45.067
And added, "As my
football coach used to say,

00:06:45.067 --> 00:06:47.200
'Lot's of luck
in your senior year.'"

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.901
But take that
with a grain of salt

00:06:48.901 --> 00:06:50.934
because his coach
also used to say,

00:06:50.934 --> 00:06:53.567
"One day this game
will be played with helmets."

00:06:53.567 --> 00:06:55.567
[ Laughter ]

00:06:58.167 --> 00:07:00.934
Ahead of last night's speech,
House Speaker Kevin McCarthy

00:07:00.934 --> 00:07:02.634
reportedly told Republican
lawmakers

00:07:02.634 --> 00:07:03.968
to be on their best behavior.

00:07:03.968 --> 00:07:07.968
"Fine! I'll put the safety on,"
said Lauren Boebert.

00:07:07.968 --> 00:07:10.267
[ Laughter ]

00:07:10.267 --> 00:07:13.934
Zoom CEO Eric Yuan yesterday
announced plans to cut staff.

00:07:13.934 --> 00:07:16.501
And said he will reduce
his own salary by 98%.

00:07:16.501 --> 00:07:18.868
Making him the only person
that can legitimately claim

00:07:18.868 --> 00:07:21.868
that the vaccine
made his life worse.

00:07:21.868 --> 00:07:24.868
[ Laughter ]

00:07:24.868 --> 00:07:27.868
And finally, according to a new
study 18% of Americans

00:07:27.868 --> 00:07:29.367
use a sleep medication.

00:07:29.367 --> 00:07:32.467
Whereas, the others prefer to
fall asleep the traditional way,

00:07:32.467 --> 00:07:35.367
reliving every awkward moment
of their lives.

00:07:35.367 --> 00:07:36.901
[ Laughter ]

00:07:36.901 --> 00:07:39.400
President Biden today,
traveled to Florida

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.534
and spoke about
Social Security and Medicare.

00:07:41.534 --> 00:07:44.000
He didn't intend to, it's just
what everybody in Florida

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.400
was already talking about.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.000
[ Laughter ]

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.200
Democratic Congressman
James Clyburn praised

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:52.167
President Biden's State of the
Union performance yesterday

00:07:52.167 --> 00:07:54.801
and said Biden displayed,
"The kind of maturity

00:07:54.801 --> 00:07:57.334
that the American people would
like to see in a president."

00:07:57.334 --> 00:07:59.901
When you say maturity,
you mean this guy?

00:07:59.901 --> 00:08:01.734
[ Laughter ]

00:08:01.734 --> 00:08:04.267
You're talking about this guy?

00:08:04.267 --> 00:08:07.067
I think that's the maturity you
expect from your cool uncle.

00:08:07.067 --> 00:08:08.868
"Hey, hop in kid.

00:08:08.868 --> 00:08:10.200
We're gonna go to
Dave and Busters.

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:13.133
I got a bucket
full of quarters."

00:08:13.133 --> 00:08:15.000
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer praised

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.501
President Biden yesterday
for baiting Republicans

00:08:17.501 --> 00:08:20.501
into a bi-partisan agenda during
the State of the Union Address

00:08:20.501 --> 00:08:23.300
and said, "He let
them walk into his trap."

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.267
Alright, that might be
a little generous.

00:08:25.267 --> 00:08:27.000
It's more like
when someone falls

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.334
running away from Michael Myers.

00:08:28.334 --> 00:08:30.334
Was it a trap?

00:08:30.334 --> 00:08:32.467
Or did Michael Myers
just get lucky?"

00:08:32.467 --> 00:08:34.067
[ Laughter ]

00:08:34.067 --> 00:08:37.200
That's right, Schumer said Biden
let them walk into his trap

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:40.367
while Marjorie Taylor Greene
let a seal walk into hers.

00:08:40.367 --> 00:08:42.868
[ Laughter ]

00:08:46.701 --> 00:08:48.667
Georgia Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:08:48.667 --> 00:08:50.901
yesterday defended her
heckling of President Biden

00:08:50.901 --> 00:08:52.400
during the State of the Union
and said,

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:54.400
"I don't clap for liars."

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:57.033
Well, whatever she claps for,
it's definitely on the

00:08:57.033 --> 00:08:58.400
ones and threes.

00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:02.834
[ Laughter ]

00:09:02.834 --> 00:09:04.567
You know what?
For the people who got it,

00:09:04.567 --> 00:09:05.901
I think they're gonna
like it a great deal.

00:09:05.901 --> 00:09:07.167
[ Laughter ]

00:09:07.167 --> 00:09:09.200
Do I think both you and I knew,
Baze, that wasn't

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:12.167
for everybody,
but for the people it was for --

00:09:12.167 --> 00:09:13.100
Fred, did you like it?

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:15.734
-Oh yes.
-Yeah, there you go, see?

00:09:15.734 --> 00:09:17.267
Some of these jokes
are for drummers.

00:09:17.267 --> 00:09:19.501
[ Laughter ]

00:09:19.501 --> 00:09:21.000
North Korean leader
Kim Jong Un

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:23.801
was joined on stage yesterday
by his 9-year-old daughter

00:09:23.801 --> 00:09:26.534
at a military parade unveiling
the country's new missiles.

00:09:26.534 --> 00:09:28.834
So, I guess
bring-your-daughter-to-work day

00:09:28.834 --> 00:09:30.601
has officially
jumped the shark.

00:09:30.601 --> 00:09:33.467
[ Laughter ]

00:09:33.467 --> 00:09:35.634
New York Congressman Nick Lalota
Referred to fellow

00:09:35.634 --> 00:09:37.567
Republican representative
George Santos during

00:09:37.567 --> 00:09:40.167
an interview yesterday as
a "sociopath"

00:09:40.167 --> 00:09:43.434
which ironically is the only
thing not on his resume.

00:09:43.434 --> 00:09:45.934
[ Laughter ]

00:09:45.934 --> 00:09:48.868
Ukrainian President Zelenskyy
met with King Charles yesterday

00:09:48.868 --> 00:09:49.901
at Buckingham palace.

00:09:49.901 --> 00:09:52.667
"How's the war going,"
asked Zelenskyy.

00:09:52.667 --> 00:09:55.968
[ Laughter ]

00:09:55.968 --> 00:09:58.968
[ Applause ]

00:10:04.567 --> 00:10:06.567
[ Laughter ]

00:10:07.901 --> 00:10:11.734
Fire fighters in -- we should
say right now -- you know what,

00:10:11.734 --> 00:10:15.167
this joke is very dependent
on a graphic.

00:10:15.167 --> 00:10:16.567
We haven't seen it yet.

00:10:16.567 --> 00:10:20.801
We're gonna find out in real
time if this joke pays off.

00:10:20.801 --> 00:10:22.734
[ Laughter ]

00:10:22.734 --> 00:10:25.000
I think
in the writing of the joke,

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.868
he had a very clear idea
of what it was gonna look like,

00:10:26.868 --> 00:10:30.200
and now we're gonna find out.

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.801
Fire fighters in Pennsylvania
were recently called to remove

00:10:32.801 --> 00:10:35.300
a cake pan that got stuck
on a girl's head.

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:38.801
And right before picture day.

00:10:38.801 --> 00:10:41.801
[ Audience "aws," laughter ]

00:10:47.634 --> 00:10:50.133
[ Laughter continues ]

00:10:54.868 --> 00:10:57.033
I guess you can win them all.

00:10:57.033 --> 00:10:58.901
[ Laughter ]

00:10:58.901 --> 00:11:01.934
And finally, authorities in
Texas arrested a man this week

00:11:01.934 --> 00:11:04.300
who they believe broke into
the Dallas zoo

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.767
and stole two monkeys.

00:11:05.767 --> 00:11:08.634
Though when reached for comment,
the man was, you guessed it,

00:11:08.634 --> 00:11:11.767
already busted out
by two monkeys.

00:11:11.767 --> 00:11:14.167
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:11:14.167 --> 00:11:18.300
♪♪

